# Whats On africa

Each month we will be checking out Whats on in Africa returning to the roots of djembe with Bassidi in Mali. [Bassidi](http://bassidikonemusic.com/) and Freya have been extremely busy with [Bwazan](http://bwazan-mali.com/) including the purchase of the new Bwazan Bus! A reliable vehicle big enough to fit the whole group and all their instruments, not to mention their talent! Speaking of talent check out the very recent video of Bassidi and Bwazan below.  Eish... these guys is phenomenal! https://www.youtube.com/watch?t=89&v=\_Xxs0r8eO4U
